dmvB0mVP-y0XGuC384134ktE9kNsJdzOWD062V2HGnzHz0rHEdVYG_ORs7oP-Q2zR4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Aftdxqw4zIQAYa-QepuTnJRJnXXClkIQNGVof3BDKh7HEQ&oe=69A971B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "IDEAL's Virtual Electrician Experience (IVEE)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Through IDEAL's Virtual Electrician Experience, you\u2019ll experience a day in the life of an electrician. Interact and get familiar with IDEAL Industries, Inc.\u2019s tools in a virtual jobsite. Troubleshoot and repair wiring on a packaging machine in a realistic on-the-job scenario. Once you\u2019re done, you\u2019ll receive a score based on your performance. Whether you\u2019re a pro with a perfect score or you need some hints along the way, this app is for anyone to enjoy. The Virtual Electrician Experience is an immersive VR experience that\u2019s perfect for people interested in the electrical trade who want to learn more about the industry.", "short_description": "Through IDEAL's Virtual Electrician Experience, you\u2019ll experience a day in the life of an electrician. Interact and get familiar with IDEAL Industries, Inc.\u2019s tools. Troubleshoot and repair wiring on a packaging machine in a realistic on-the-job scenario. Once you\u2019re done, you\u2019ll receive a score based on your performance. The Virtual Electrician Experience is an immersive VR experience that\u2019s perfect for people interested in the electrical trade who want to learn more about the industry."}]}, "developer_name": "IVRY Technologies", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://idealind-my.sharepoint.com/:w:/g/personal/rmoraga_idealindustries_com/EYkHu-Wjc4lGk4DrlxDuyi8BPIIh_PR4Xkgh5-l75eQlIQ?e=j9a6an", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IDEAL Industries", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ivrytechnologies.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_cat